      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex (gpt-6-astra), reconciling independent Tibetan-first and English-first proposals. The full blo'i g-yo ba phrase supplies GMR's thought it over at phrase depth; g-yo ba does not independently own over. The relational predicate sngon du btang supplies first at phrase depth. Nas and the duplicated created framing are left unwrapped: the sole byas pa owns the first created only. De'i owns only of this; quotation remains unwrapped. The source rejects an unchanging creator and identifies the beings' non-virtuous minds as makers. The byed pa por maker role is distributed through what really made all these things and stays unbanked, not null. Sdig sems and its two members are provisional corpus matches, with no promotion into the master gloss. La sogs pa and sogs own their attested closing gestures and so on and or something like that. GIE mental-intention parallels support only their shared phrase extent. All GMR English and source Tibetan remain verbatim."
